han Daun Penh","Daily 08:00-17:00, last admission 16:30","","","","r","Contains an excellent collection of art from Cambodia's \"golden age\" of Angkor, and a lovely courtyard at the centre. A main attraction is the statue of King Jayavarman VII (1181-1219) in a meditative pose. Other exhibits worth seeing…"],["The Royal Palace and Silver Pagoda","sight",11.56368,104.93112,"Sothearos Blvd","08:00-10:00 & 14:00-17:00","","","","r","The King of Cambodia still lives here, but much of the palace is open to the public. The manicured gardens are nearly as dazzling as the colorful glass tiles of the palace roof. The two magnificent pagodas in the Palace Grounds, the…"],["Sisowath Quay","sight",11.56674,104.93203,"","","","","","r","Phnom Penh is a bite-sized town, and it's easy to combine sightseeing, shopping, eating and drinking into a single walk through the city. The key to connecting the dots is the town's riverside promenade, Sisowath Quay, which runs along…"],["Wat Phnom","sight",11.57604,104.92307,"Norodom Blvd at St 94","07:00-18:30","","","","r","This hilltop pagoda marks the spot where the city was founded, and is always busy with pilgrims and fortune-tellers. The temple is notable more for its historic importance than physical structure, but the park is a pleasant green space…"],["Wat Ounalom","sight",11.5678,104.93,"Samdech Sothearos Blvd","06:00-18:00","","","","r","Dates back to 1422 and is one of the five original founding monasteries of Phnom Penh."],["Wat Langka","sight",11.56583,104.92667,"","","","","","r","Offers free meditation session on Mondays and Thursdays at 18:00."],["Sosoro Museum","sight",11.57433,104.92545,"#16 106 Preah Moha Ksatreiyani Kossamak Avenue","Tue-Sun 09:00-18:00","","","","r","Opened 2019, this is a modern museum about money. 2,000 years of Cambodia’s monetary history through display cases and panels enhanced by multimedia presentations, and interactive exhibits. Even if you are not generally interested in…"],["Mekong River Cruises","activity",11.57775,104.92539,"","","","","","r","Boats leave every evening for a river cruise. Many provide snacks or dinners at sunset. Be sure to visit Mekong Island to see rural life."],["Surn Yi Vegetarian Restaurant","restaurant",11.56391,104.92704,"15 Samdach Preah Thoamak Lekhet Ouk St","","","","","r","Vegetarian restaurant with a variety of dishes including Chinese and Western options. Order by writing the item numbers on a laminated sheet with the marker provided."],["The Shop","restaurant",11.56006,104.92833,"#39, St 240","Daily 07:00-19:00","","","","r","Popular place with a good selection of sandwiches, quiches, salads and freshly baked goods plus nice coffee too. Has a cosy and quiet courtyard seating area. Very good breakfast options."],["Cousin's Burger Coffee","bar",11.56245,104.9253,"16, St 200","11:00-21:00","","","","r","French-run, French-style. Coffees as well as burger, fries and soft drinks."],["Luxuries Cafe","bar",11.57187,104.9214,"","06:00-23:00","","","","r","True to its name this is a very comfortable and luxurious cafe. Has both photo drinks and food menus. Prices surprisingly not expensive."],["Chhma Catfe","bar",11.5665,104.93,"3, St 178","08:30-20:30","","","","r","A cat cafe where you can enjoy a nice hot or cold drink in the company of lots of playful cats, when they are not sleeping or eating."],["Bouchon","bar",11.5642,104.9204,"St 174","11:00-14:00, 16:00-00:00","","","","r","French wine and cocktails bar with gourmet food. Famous for its near half price US$3 martinis on Saturday nights 21:00-00:00."],["Cloud9 Skybar","bar",11.57035,104.927,"#68 Street 136","","","","","r","In the evenings at Sun & Moon Urban Hotel, guests and local residents can chill out in style at Cloud 9, the hotel’s rooftop bar, with cool beats, creative cocktails, and spectacular views over Phnom Penh city. Poolside BBQ parties and…"]]}